<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>PrompTugal: the industry, and the right direction</title>
<meta name="description" content="Why the news industry is struggling and still looking the wrong way, and the direction PrompTugal takes: accurate information, kept current, provenance, privacy by design. Investor deck 2, November 2026.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="deck.css">
<style>
.flow .step h3 { font-size: 30px; }
</style></head>
<body><main class="deck">

<!-- 1 · cover -->
<section class="slide pic lightpic">
  <img class="bg" src="img/hero-industry.jpg" alt="" style="left:560px;width:1360px;object-position:40% 50%">
  <div class="veil" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(246,243,236,1) 0%,rgba(246,243,236,1) 31%,rgba(246,243,236,.75) 40%,rgba(246,243,236,0) 54%)"></div>
  <div class="head"><span><b>Investors</b> · deck 2</span><span>v1.1 · 7 November 2026</span></div>
  <div class="inner" style="max-width:1000px">
    <div class="kicker">The industry, and the right direction</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:100px">News is looking the wrong way. <span style="color:#c52830">We are not.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead" style="font-size:32px">The publishing industry got hooked on advertising, then on subscriptions, and stopped inventing. Readers want accurate information, kept current, that saves them time. PrompTugal is built for that, and it is already running.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span style="background:rgba(246,243,236,.9);padding:6px 10px">The industry</span></div>
</section>
<!-- 2 · how news got here -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>How news got here</b></span><span>02</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Two hundred years, two business models, one product: the reader</div>
  <h2>First the reader was sold. Then the reader was charged rent.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 470" width="1680" height="470" style="margin-top:44px">
    <rect x="0" y="0" width="960" height="96" fill="#f8e4df"/>
    <text x="28" y="40" class="mono" font-size="22" fill="#c52830" letter-spacing="2">ADVERTISING</text>
    <text x="28" y="74" font-size="24" fill="#121317">the reader's attention is what is sold</text>
    <rect x="960" y="0" width="280" height="96" fill="#ece7db"/>
    <text x="984" y="40" class="mono" font-size="22" fill="#595c64" letter-spacing="2">THE WEB</text>
    <text x="984" y="74" font-size="24" fill="#121317">takes the monopoly</text>
    <rect x="1240" y="0" width="440" height="96" fill="#121317"/>
    <text x="1264" y="40" class="mono" font-size="22" fill="#8fd18f" letter-spacing="2">RENT</text>
    <text x="1264" y="74" font-size="24" fill="#f6f3ec">subscriptions and paywalls</text>
    <line x1="0" y1="150" x2="1680" y2="150" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="4"/>
    <g class="mono" font-size="22" fill="#595c64" text-anchor="middle">
      <circle cx="40" cy="150" r="13" fill="#f6f3ec" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="6"/><text x="40" y="125">1833</text>
      <circle cx="660" cy="150" r="13" fill="#f6f3ec" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="6"/><text x="660" y="125">2005</text>
      <circle cx="1040" cy="150" r="13" fill="#f6f3ec" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="6"/><text x="1040" y="125">2008</text>
      <circle cx="1240" cy="150" r="13" fill="#f6f3ec" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="6"/><text x="1240" y="125">2020</text>
      <circle cx="1640" cy="150" r="13" fill="#c52830" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="6"/><text x="1640" y="125">2026</text>
    </g>
    <!-- 1833 -->
    <line x1="40" y1="166" x2="40" y2="210" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2"/>
    <text x="0" y="290" class="serif" font-size="84" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">1833</text>
    <text x="0" y="336" font-size="24" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">The penny press.</text>
    <text x="0" y="368" font-size="24" fill="#3f424a">The paper is cheap because</text>
    <text x="0" y="400" font-size="24" fill="#3f424a">the reader becomes the product.</text>
    <!-- 2005 -->
    <line x1="660" y1="166" x2="660" y2="210" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2"/>
    <rect x="600" y="220" width="46" height="36" fill="#d9d2c1"/>
    <rect x="600" y="256" width="46" height="164" fill="#c52830"/>
    <text x="623" y="448" text-anchor="middle" class="mono" font-size="18" fill="#595c64">100%</text>
    <text x="672" y="290" class="serif" font-size="84" font-weight="600" fill="#c52830">82%</text>
    <text x="672" y="336" font-size="24" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">of US newspaper revenue</text>
    <text x="672" y="368" font-size="24" fill="#3f424a">was advertising, in 2005.</text>
    <text x="672" y="400" font-size="24" fill="#3f424a">Then the web took it.</text>
    <!-- 2008-2020 -->
    <path d="M1040,170 V186 H1240 V170" fill="none" stroke="#c52830" stroke-width="3"/>
    <text x="1004" y="290" class="serif" font-size="84" font-weight="600" fill="#c52830">&#8722;57%</text>
    <text x="1004" y="336" font-size="24" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">US newsroom jobs,</text>
    <text x="1004" y="368" font-size="24" fill="#3f424a">2008 to 2020.</text>
    <!-- 2026 -->
    <line x1="1640" y1="166" x2="1640" y2="210" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="2"/>
    <text x="1680" y="290" text-anchor="end" class="serif" font-size="84" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">37%</text>
    <text x="1680" y="336" text-anchor="end" font-size="24" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">trust the news;</text>
    <text x="1680" y="368" text-anchor="end" font-size="24" fill="#3f424a">42% avoid it.</text>
  </svg>
  <div style="display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:30px;margin-top:6px;border-left:8px solid #c52830;padding-left:30px">
    <p style="font:italic 400 44px/1.2 var(--serif);color:#121317">"The industry did not go back to 1832. It went to rent."</p>
    <span class="mono" style="font:500 20px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#595c64;white-space:nowrap">DINIS CRUZ</span>
  </div>
  <div class="src">Not to scale. Figures as cited by Dinis Cruz in "The future of news is the story vault, not the paywall" (22 Sep 2026) and "The reader was always the product" (29 Sep 2026), newsroom.sgit.ai; trust and avoidance: Reuters Institute, 2026.</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The industry</span></div>
</section>
<!-- 3 · the numbers -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The numbers</b></span><span>03</span></div>
  <div class="kicker red">Readers are walking away</div>
  <h2>Fewer trust it. More avoid it. Fewer make it.</h2>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:56px;gap:64px">
    <div class="stat" style="padding-left:34px">
      <div class="v" style="color:#121317">37%</div>
      <div class="l" style="min-height:70px"><b style="color:#121317">trust the news.</b> Each square is one person in a hundred.</div>
      <div style="margin-top:26px"><svg viewBox="0 0 354 354" width="354" height="354"><rect x="0" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="36" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="72" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="108" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="144" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="180" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="216" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="252" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="288" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="324" y="0" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="0" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="36" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="72" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="108" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="144" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="180" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="216" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="252" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="288" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="324" y="36" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="0" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="36" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="72" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="108" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="144" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="180" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="216" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="252" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="288" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="324" y="72" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="0" y="108" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="36" y="108" width="30" height="30" fill="#121317"/><rect x="72" y="