<!-- 6 · what people want -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>What people want</b></span><span>06</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">The users moved away from the product, not from the need</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:68px">Not more articles. Information they can trust, that saves them time.</h2>
  <div class="cols c3" style="margin-top:48px;gap:40px">
    <div class="card g" style="padding:38px 36px 36px">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 140 140" width="140" height="140"><rect x="22" y="10" width="82" height="108" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="4"/>
<line x1="36" y1="34" x2="90" y2="34" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="5"/><line x1="36" y1="52" x2="90" y2="52" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="5"/><line x1="36" y1="70" x2="74" y2="70" stroke="#9d9580" stroke-width="5"/>
<circle cx="98" cy="100" r="30" fill="#006600"/><path d="M84,100 L95,111 L113,89" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      <div style="font:600 64px/1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:22px 0 18px">Accurate.</div>
      <p>Every fact with its source and the date it was read; every article signed by whoever wrote it.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding-top:18px;font:500 19px/1.4 var(--mono);color:#006600;letter-spacing:.04em">ON PROMPTUGAL · 31 SIGNED ARTICLES, EVERY FACT SOURCED</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card g" style="padding:38px 36px 36px">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 140 140" width="140" height="140"><path d="M112,70 A42,42 0 1 1 98,38" fill="none" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<path d="M86,22 L106,36 L88,52" fill="none" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
<circle cx="70" cy="70" r="15" fill="#006600"/></svg>
      <div style="font:600 64px/1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:22px 0 18px">Current.</div>
      <p>Kept up to date for as long as the story runs, not printed once and left to go stale.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding-top:18px;font:500 19px/1.4 var(--mono);color:#006600;letter-spacing:.04em">ON PROMPTUGAL · THE FRONT PAGE, REFRESHED EVERY DAY</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card g" style="padding:38px 36px 36px">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 140 140" width="140" height="140"><path d="M36,12 H104 M36,128 H104" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
<path d="M44,14 C44,52 96,56 96,70 C96,84 44,88 44,126 M96,14 C96,52 44,56 44,70 C44,84 96,88 96,126" fill="none" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="5"/>
<path d="M54,112 C58,98 82,98 86,112 Z" fill="#006600"/><path d="M58,30 H82 C80,42 60,42 58,30 Z" fill="#006600" opacity=".5"/></svg>
      <div style="font:600 64px/1 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:22px 0 18px">Time saved.</div>
      <p>The talk you would have missed, where to go, who is there: the answer, not a pile of pages.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding-top:18px;font:500 19px/1.4 var(--mono);color:#006600;letter-spacing:.04em">ON PROMPTUGAL · MY DAY, THE GRAPH, ASK THE NEWSROOM</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top:34px;font-size:30px">People will pay for accurate information, <b>"because it's going to save them time"</b> (Dinis Cruz).</p>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The industry · counts from the public repository, 7 Nov 2026</span></div>
</section>
<!-- 7 · the bridge -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The bridge</b></span><span>07</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">A worked example: a local bridge closes for 57 days</div>
  <h2>The paper leads with it five times. Readers need it on fifty-seven days.</h2>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1680 420" width="1680" height="420" style="margin-top:40px">
