<!-- 11 · the landscape -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The landscape</b></span><span>11</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">The products closest to us, in four groups</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:66px">Each of them does one part. Of those we read, each does one part.</h2>
  <div class="cols c4" style="margin-top:44px;gap:24px;align-items:stretch">
    <div class="card" style="padding:30px 28px 26px;border-top-color:#595c64;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <div class="n">01 · AI AND NEWS</div><h3 style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:16px">Summarise, script, grade</h3>
      <ul style="list-style:none;font:400 23px/1.34 var(--sans);color:#3f424a;flex:1"><li style="margin-bottom:20px"><b style="color:#121317">Particle</b><br><span>AI summaries of others' reporting</span></li><li style="margin-bottom:20px"><b style="color:#121317">Channel 1</b><br><span>cited scripts and video for media</span></li><li style="margin-bottom:20px"><b style="color:#121317">NewsGuard</b><br><span>rates the reliability of sources</span></li></ul>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding-top:12px;margin-top:6px;font:400 19px/1.35 var(--mono);color:#595c64">MONEY: partnerships, data products; Particle's notice mentions ads</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="padding:30px 28px 26px;border-top-color:#595c64;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <div class="n">02 · EVENT APPS</div><h3 style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:16px">Serve the organiser</h3>
      <ul style="list-style:none;font:400 23px/1.34 var(--sans);color:#3f424a;flex:1"><li style="margin-bottom:20px"><b style="color:#121317">Web Summit's app</b><br><span>schedule, meetups, networking</span></li><li style="margin-bottom:20px"><b style="color:#121317">Swapcard</b><br><span>registration, app, matchmaking</span></li><li style="margin-bottom:20px"><b style="color:#121317">Brella</b><br><span>matchmaking, sponsor meetings</span></li></ul>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding-top:12px;margin-top:6px;font:400 19px/1.35 var(--mono);color:#595c64">MONEY: sold to organisers, sponsors, with the ticket</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="padding:30px 28px 26px;border-top-color:#595c64;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <div class="n">03 · PAYING PER READ</div><h3 style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:16px">A layer for publishers</h3>
      <ul style="list-style:none;font:400 23px/1.34 var(--sans);color:#3f424a;flex:1"><li style="margin-bottom:20px"><b style="color:#121317">Axate</b><br><span>pay as you go, passes and subscriptions for publishers</span></li></ul>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding-top:12px;margin-top:6px;font:400 19px/1.35 var(--mono);color:#595c64">MONEY: sold to publishers</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="padding:30px 28px 26px;border-top-color:#595c64;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
      <div class="n">04 · OPEN-SOURCE PUBLISHING</div><h3 style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:16px">A tool for writers</h3>
      <ul style="list-style:none;font:400 23px/1.34 var(--sans);color:#3f424a;flex:1"><li style="margin-bottom:20px"><b style="color:#121317">Ghost</b><br><span>blog and newsletter platform with paid memberships</span></li></ul>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding-top:12px;margin-top:6px;font:400 19px/1.35 var(--mono);color:#595c64">MONEY: hosting plans, funded by users</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:30px;background:#006600;color:#fff;padding:30px 36px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px">
    <div style="font:600 40px/1 var(--serif);white-space:nowrap">PrompTugal</div>
    <div style="font:400 24px/1.38 var(--sans);color:#e2eedf">All four parts in one publication: <b style="color:#fff">writes its own news, every fact sourced and signed</b>, serves the reader and the attendee, pays per read without tracking, open source, and run by a team of agents with a named human.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="src" style="margin-top:12px">Each read at its own site on 7 November 2026; what each says about how it makes money, as stated (promptugal.news/investors/competition).</div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The industry</span></div>
</section>
<!-- 12 · the opportunity -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The opportunity</b></span><span>12</span></div>
  <div class="cols center" style="grid-template-columns:760px 1fr;gap:60px;margin-top:0;height:100%">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 760 660" width="760" height="660"><line x1="380" y1="330" x2="380" y2="80" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/><line x1="380" y1="330" x2="597" y2="205" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/><line x1="380" y1="330" x2="597" y2="455" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/><line x1="380" y1="330" x2="380" y2="580" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/><line x1="380" y1="330" x2="163" y2="455" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/><line x1="380" y1="330" x2="163" y2="205" stroke="#006600" stroke-width="3"/><circle cx="380" cy="80" r="72" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3"/><text x="380" y="76" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Publishers</text><text x="380" y="102" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" fill="#3f424a">in Portugal</text><circle cx="597" cy="205" r="72" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3"/><text x="597" y="201" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Publishers</text><text x="597" y="227" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" fill="#3f424a">worldwide</text><circle cx="597" cy="455" r="72" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3"/><text x="597" y="451" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Events,</text><text x="597" y="477" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" fill="#3f424a">every week</text><circle cx="380" cy="580" r="72" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3"/><text x="380" y="576" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Companies</text><text x="380" y="602" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" fill="#3f424a">with content</text><circle cx="163" cy="455" r="72" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3"/><text x="163" y="451" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Agents</text><text x="163" y="477" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" fill="#3f424a">that read data</text><circle cx="163" cy="205" r="72" fill="#fffdf8" stroke="#121317" stroke-width="3"/><text x="163" y="201" text-anchor="middle" font-size="21" font-weight="600" fill="#121317">Other</text><text x="163" y="227" text-anchor="middle" font-size="19" fill="#3f424a">languages</text><circle cx="380" cy="330" r="112" fill="#006600"/><text x="380" y="324" text-anchor="middle" class="serif" font-size="34" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">The platform</text><text x="380" y="358" text-anchor="middle" font-size="20" fill="#e2eedf">and the team</text></svg>
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">Publishers need to change</div>
      <h2 style="font-size:62px">They can change, and we can help them do it.</h2>
      <p class="lead" style="font-size:28px;margin-top:20px">If the industry goes this way, there is work and revenue in helping existing publications, in Portugal and around the world, to run the same way.</p>
      <div class="cols" style="margin-top:30px;gap:20px">
        <div class="card g" style="padding:24px 28px 26px"><div class="n">SERVICE</div><h3 style="font-size:31px;margin-bottom:8px">The agentic team, deployed</h3><p style="font-size:22px">Roles, limits, budgets and the record, for a publication or an event.</p></div>
        <div class="card g" style="padding:24px 28px 26px"><div class="n">SERVICE</div><h3 style="font-size:31px;margin-bottom:8px">Workflows, taught and installed</h3><p style="font-size:22px">The method, the setup and the hand-over, run safely.</p></div>
        <div class="card r" style="padding:24px 28px 26px"><div class="n">LICENCE</div><h3 style="font-size:31px;margin-bottom:8px">Dual licensing</h3><p style="font-size:22px">Our open-source technology on a company's own terms, maintained by us.</p></div>
        <div class="card r" style="padding:24px 28px 26px"><div class="n">REACH</div><h3 style="font-size:31px;margin-bottom:8px">Multilingual</h3><p style="font-size:22px">Pages in more languages and cultures as the platform matures.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The industry</span></div>
</section>
<!-- 13 · what we wish -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>What we wish the industry would do</b></span><span>13</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">As thinkers, as competitors, and as a customer of the method</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:66px">Four things we wish the industry would do. We do them every day.</h2>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 1fr;gap:36px;margin-top:40px;font:500 19px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#595c64;border-bottom:3px solid #121317;padding-bottom:14px">
    <span></span><span>WHAT WE WISH</span><span>ON PROMPTUGAL TODAY</span></div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d2c1">
      <div style="font:600 84px/1 var(--serif);color:#006600">1</div>
      <div style="font:600 36px/1.2 var(--serif)">Publish its sources and sign its articles.</div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 34 34" style="flex:none;margin-top:2px"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="17" fill="#006600"/><path d="M9,17 L15,23 L25,11" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><p style="font:400 25px/1.4 var(--sans);color:#3f424a">31 signed articles; every fact with its source and the date it was read.</p></div>
    </div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d2c1">
      <div style="font:600 84px/1 var(--serif);color:#006600">2</div>
      <div style="font:600 36px/1.2 var(--serif)">Make every page readable by agents as well as people.</div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 34 34" style="flex:none;margin-top:2px"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="17" fill="#006600"/><path d="M9,17 L15,23 L25,11" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><p style="font:400 25px/1.4 var(--sans);color:#3f424a">A markdown twin for every page, an llms.txt and a JSON API.</p></div>
    </div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d2c1">
      <div style="font:600 84px/1 var(--serif);color:#006600">3</div>
      <div style="font:600 36px/1.2 var(--serif)">Stop tracking readers to sell them.</div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 34 34" style="flex:none;margin-top:2px"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="17" fill="#006600"/><path d="M9,17 L15,23 L25,11" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><p style="font:400 25px/1.4 var(--sans);color:#3f424a">No IP, no cookie; personalisation runs on the reader's side.</p></div>
    </div>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d2c1">
      <div style="font:600 84px/1 var(--serif);color:#006600">4</div>
      <div style="font:600 36px/1.2 var(--serif)">Try agentic teams with written limits and a human who decides.</div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start"><svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 34 34" style="flex:none;margin-top:2px"><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="17" fill="#006600"/><path d="M9,17 L15,23 L25,11" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><p style="font:400 25px/1.4 var(--sans);color:#3f424a">About 25 named roles, each with a key, a written policy, a budget and run reports.</p></div>
    </div>
  <div class="foot"><span class="wordmark">Promp<span class="t">T</span><span class="u">ugal</span><i>.news</i></span><span>The industry · counts from the public repository, 7 Nov 2026</span></div>
</section>
<!-- 14 · the right direction -->
<section class="slide">
  <div class="head"><span><b>The right direction</b></span><span>14</span></div>
  <div class="kicker">Same need, opposite direction</div>
  <h2 style="font-size:70px">Where the industry looks, and where we are going.</h2>
  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr 70px 1fr;margin-top:40px;border-bottom:3px solid #121317;padding-bottom:14px;font:500 20px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em">
