  </div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr 70px 1fr;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding:17px 0">
    <div style="font:500 19px/1.2 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#595c64">Reader data</div>
    <div style="font:400 28px/1.3 var(--sans);color:#595c64;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:#c52830;text-decoration-thickness:2px">tracked, profiled, sold</div>
    <div style="font:600 40px/1 var(--serif);color:#006600">&#8594;</div>
    <div style="font:600 30px/1.3 var(--sans);color:#121317">kept by the reader, in their vault</div>
  </div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr 70px 1fr;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding:17px 0">
    <div style="font:500 19px/1.2 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#595c64">Why believe it</div>
    <div style="font:400 28px/1.3 var(--sans);color:#595c64;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:#c52830;text-decoration-thickness:2px">the brand says so</div>
    <div style="font:600 40px/1 var(--serif);color:#006600">&#8594;</div>
    <div style="font:600 30px/1.3 var(--sans);color:#121317">provenance: sources, evidence, signatures</div>
  </div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:300px 1fr 70px 1fr;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d2c1;padding:17px 0">
    <div style="font:500 19px/1.2 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#595c64">Who makes it</div>
    <div style="font:400 28px/1.3 var(--sans);color:#595c64;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:#c52830;text-decoration-thickness:2px">a shrinking newsroom</div>
    <div style="font:600 40px/1 var(--serif);color:#006600">&#8594;</div>
    <div style="font:600 30px/1.3 var(--sans);color:#121317">people and agents, released many times a day</div>
  </div>
