  <div class="head"><span><b>The right direction</b></span><span>15</span></div>
  <div class="inner" style="max-width:1180px">
    <div class="kicker">Not the paywall: the evidence</div>
    <p class="bigquote" style="color:#fff">"Trust through provenance, provenance via evidence."<span class="who">Dinis Cruz · founder · newsroom.sgit.ai</span></p>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:50px;max-width:960px">The industry sells the one thing whose price is going to zero. <b style="color:#fff">We sell what it cannot make free: news you can check, kept current, that saves you time.</b></p>
